单独保存等级、性格、努力值和个体值；计算时还要读取该成员与目标的实际配置。说明一只成员的速度时，应区分种族值、已保存的等级与培养条件，以及计算结果，不能用其中一种数值冒充另一种。\n\n项目数据对象在未提供时会采用等级50、性格hardy、努力值全0、个体值全31的填写默认值；hardy在界面中显示为勤奋。这些是项目缺省值，不证明用户主动选择，也不是最优培养方案。招式、特性和道具为空仍是缺失条件。分析时应说明哪些配置已经保存，哪些只是缺省；用户没有确认低攻击或低速度个体值等条件时，不能替用户设定。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/engine/LocalDamageEngine.java","sha256":"32f1dee574465dd652fcce0933a70fda8b465abff962133905422413bc3a1efe"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["training","project"]}},"score":3346,"checksum":"sha256:48fcf0dc827ab6c520c993413c019c7cf296aa357618a6cf7ab065319ada0399","citation":{"chunkId":"...(truncated, total 6561 chars)
